ACCIDENTAL LOSS OF OR DAMAGE TO THE VEHICLE
INSURED
1. The Company will indemnify the insured against accidental loss
or damage to the vehicle insured hereunder and / or its
accessories whilst thereon
i. by fire, explosion, self-ignition or lightning;
ii. by burglary, housebreaking or theft ;
iii. by riot and strike;
iv. by earthquake (fire and shock damage);
v. by flood, typhoon, hurricane, storm

